OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed owl saved by soldiers 70
OL,4,Amiles out at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barn owl was rescued by a group of
OL,7,Fsoldiers after it was seen struggling
OL,8,F70 miles from shore.
OL,10,FAfter falling into the sea on several
OL,11,Foccasions, the bird "collapsed" on a
OL,12,Fboat filled with members of the British
OL,13,FArmy taking part in a race around
OL,14,FBritain and Ireland.
OL,16,FThe crew looked after it until the
OL,17,FCaister Independent Lifeboat met the
OL,18,Fsoldiers off the Norfolk coast and
OL,19,Ftransported the owl to land.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
