OL,3,GNEWSACollapsed owl saved by soldiers 70
OL,4,Amiles out at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Petherbridge, a member of the Army
OL,7,FOffshore Racing Team, said: "It's been
OL,8,Fa tough 24 hours for him; it's not the
OL,9,Fmost comfortable boat to be on, but
OL,10,Fhe's doing well, and hopefully he gets
OL,11,Fthe help he needs now."
